In my last game I used a bag of holding lying on Elbereth as home base
for all my non-combat goodies. When shoving in some things I got the message:

The bag named holding blows apart!  You are blasted by a magical explosion!

Now I found out later (after reciting a selection of short words) that 
putting a wand of cancellation in a bag of holding will cause this. I had 
umpteen wands so this could be possible, but I wonder if this is the only way.
And also; is this intentional or just a bug.

Erik.


